{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 今日公佈 <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/11/meet-the-2026-app-store-award-finalists/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2026 App Store Awards</a> 的決選名單，共 45 款應用程式與遊戲入圍，涵蓋 iPhone、iPad、Mac、Apple Vision Pro、Apple Watch、Apple TV、Apple Arcade 及文化影響八大組別。獲獎作品將於未來數週內揭曉，名單由 App Store 編輯團隊選出。以下按平台整理全部入圍名單，應用與遊戲名稱可直接前往 App Store 頁面。</p>\n<h2>iPhone 與 iPad：年度最佳應用及遊戲</h2>\n<figure><img alt=\"2026 App Store 獎 iPhone 決選應用\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/iPhone-Store-Finalists-Apps-2026.jpg\" width=\"1500\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>iPhone 年度應用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/elevenreader-read-books-aloud/id6479373050/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>ElevenReader</strong></a>：以自然流暢的 AI 語音朗讀電子書與文章</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/not-boring-camera/id6737783441/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>(Not Boring) Camera</strong></a>：把 iPhone 變成可自訂的復古相機</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/raylie-flight-view-guide/id6793443320/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Raylie</strong></a>：為每班航班提供個人化導覽旅程</li></ul>\n<p><strong>iPhone 年度遊戲</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ball-x-pit/id6738703497/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>BALL x PIT</strong></a>：打破打磚塊框架的混合玩法</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dave-the-diver/id6759962259/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>DAVE THE DIVER</strong></a>：深海探索與潛水冒險</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gambonanza/id6747752407/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Gambonanza</strong></a>：重新改寫國際象棋規則</li></ul>\n<p><strong>iPad 年度應用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cosmos-search-discover/id1577975475/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cosmos</strong></a>：以精美心情板啟發靈感的搜尋工具</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/kiddopia-kids-learning-games/id1223397201/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Kiddopia</strong></a>：讓幼童在遊戲中快樂學習</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mockup-ui-ux-design/id1527554407/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Mockup</strong></a>：人人可設計網站或 App 介面</li></ul>\n<p><strong>iPad 年度遊戲</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/aniimo/id6759098797/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Aniimo</strong></a>：帶可愛生物展開奇幻任務</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/arknights-endfield/id6752642477/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Arknights: Endfield</strong></a>：在遙遠月球打響華麗戰鬥</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/where-winds-meet/id6472396866/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Where Winds Meet</strong></a>：電影感十足的武術動作</li></ul>\n<h2>Mac、Apple Arcade 與 Vision Pro</h2>\n<p><strong>Mac 年度應用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/paste-limitless-clipboard/id967805235/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Paste</strong></a>：大幅強化 Mac 剪貼板</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/things-3/id904237743/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Things 3</strong></a>：以簡潔介面處理待辦事項</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ulysses-writing-app/id1225570693/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Ulysses</strong></a>：輕鬆製作排版精美的文件</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Mac 年度遊戲</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/big-walk/id6773484032?mt=12/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Big Walk</strong></a>：與朋友一起解謎散步</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/blue-prince/id6752822014?mt=12/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Blue Prince</strong></a>：充滿意外的神秘大宅</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/crimson-desert-enhanced/id6747100856?mt=12/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Crimson Desert</strong></a>：遼闊的戰火奇幻世界</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Apple Arcade 年度遊戲</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/perchang-world/id6477922353/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Perchang World</strong></a>：彈珠物理謎題</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/powerwash-simulator/id6477445344/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PowerWash Simulator</strong></a>：清洗污垢的療癒體驗</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pusheens-place/id6502513973/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Pusheen’s Place</strong></a>：以可愛貓咪為主角</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Apple Vision Pro 年度應用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/adobe-premiere-ai-video-editor/id6742757464/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Adobe Premiere</strong></a>：在空間畫布上剪輯影片</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mlb/id493619333/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>MLB</strong></a>：以本壘後視角直播棒球賽</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/museas/id6496682427/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Museas</strong></a>：把客廳變成美術館</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Apple Vision Pro 年度遊戲</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cueva-de-las-manos/id6777099953/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cueva de las Manos</strong></a>：以光影設計的獨特謎題</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ping-pong-club-table-tennis/id6739363110/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Ping Pong Club</strong></a>：沉浸式乒乓球對戰</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/spatial-ops-campaign-edition/id6742558471/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Spatial Ops</strong></a>：在自家中展開第一身戰鬥</li></ul>\n<h2>Apple Watch 與 Apple TV</h2>\n<p><strong>Apple Watch 年度應用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/bevel-ai-health-coach/id6456176249/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Bevel</strong></a>：把健身數據變成可行建議</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/moonlitt-moon-phase-tracker/id6444718902/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Moonlitt</strong></a>：提示即將出現的月相事件</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stresswatch-ai-stress-monitor/id6444737095/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>StressWatch</strong></a>：實時回報壓力水平</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Apple TV 年度應用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/case-solved-the-london-files/id6769660234/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Case Solved: The London Files</strong></a>：黑色電影風格推理謎題</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/letterboxd/id1054271011/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Letterboxd</strong></a>：集合影評人與朋友的電影推薦</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pocket-casts-podcast-player/id414834813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Pocket Casts</strong></a>：把播客帶上大螢幕</li></ul>\n<h2>文化影響獎：應用與遊戲</h2>\n<p>文化影響組別不看技術規格，而是看作品如何改變用戶生活：由聾人溝通、環保行動、鄰里互助，到飲食失調與墨西哥飲食文化，題材相當分散。</p>\n<p><strong>文化影響年度應用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/brilliant-learn-math-coding/id913335252/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Brilliant</strong></a>：教授數學與科學基礎</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/chilli-take-action-today/id1645549437/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>chilli</strong></a>：輕鬆參與環保政治行動</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hearing-buddy-speech-to-text/id6747363502/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Hearing Buddy</strong></a>：協助聽障人士跟上對話</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/karrot-buy-sell-locally/id1018769995/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Karrot</strong></a>：促進鄰里之間的循環經濟</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/setlog-friends-camera/id6587576438/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>setlog</strong></a>：為社交媒體帶來更多真實感</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/unedo-spanish-games-stories/id6503170902/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Unedo</strong></a>：以遊戲方式學習西班牙語與文化</li></ul>\n<p><strong>文化影響年度遊戲</strong></p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/and-roger/id6761811652/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>and Roger</strong></a>：講述感人而沉重的個人故事</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/consume-me/id6769877287/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Consume Me</strong></a>：直面飲食失調的現實</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pancitomerge/id6759935383/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PancitoMerge</strong></a>：慶祝墨西哥飲食文化</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sago-mini-jinjas-garden/id6477492925/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Sago Mini Jinja’s Garden</strong></a>：讓一家大小一起遊玩</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/spilled/id6752525411/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Spilled!</strong></a>：清理受污染水道</li><li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/tiny-bookshop/id6766267906/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Tiny Bookshop</strong></a>：營造溫馨包容的社區氛圍</li></ul>\n<h2>獲獎名單將於未來數週公佈</h2>\n<p>Apple 表示，本年度的獲獎作品會在未來幾週內陸續揭曉，完整決選名單可在 <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/11/meet-the-2026-app-store-award-finalists/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Newsroom</a> 瀏覽。今年評選由 App Store 編輯團隊負責，獎項涵蓋技術創新、用戶體驗、設計與文化影響四條主線；App Store Awards 往年結果亦常被視為 App Store 編輯推薦方向的風向標。</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:44:39.632282+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1817,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:41:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:34.126541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:38:05.512517+00:00","content_hash":"d3529a5c0266ecf3cf44a97419cd98a7dcde661e8d760d6f486a6116f3d1bd3d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}